WEBVTT

1
00:00:08,080 --> 00:00:09,080
Why is she here?

2
00:00:09,080 --> 00:00:10,080
And take so many things

3
00:00:10,080 --> 00:00:13,080
It’s not easy to chase her away. Yaqin Duck

4
00:00:13,080 --> 00:00:18,050
Come on, come in and sit down

5
00:00:18,050 --> 00:00:28,460
Big duck, come and have some cakes

6
00:00:28,460 --> 00:00:30,460
These dried fish are delicious when steamed

7
00:00:30,460 --> 00:00:32,460
These are the bacon my mother-in-law makes herself

8
00:00:32,460 --> 00:00:33,460
This is a canned food. It’s sold like a glutinous rice cake.

9
00:00:33,460 --> 00:00:34,460
Brother, you are usually tired from work

10
00:00:34,460 --> 00:00:36,460
Drink this to replenish your body.

11
00:00:36,460 --> 00:00:40,620
Why did you bring back so many good things, little sister?

12
00:00:40,620 --> 00:00:41,620
These things cost a lot of money, right?

13
00:00:41,620 --> 00:00:43,620
Brother Qian, where did you come from?

14
00:00:43,620 --> 00:00:45,620
Jianguo is now present

15
00:00:45,620 --> 00:00:47,620
He goes fishing every day

16
00:00:47,620 --> 00:00:48,620
made money

17
00:00:48,620 --> 00:00:50,620
Just improve the life of the family
